  "limitations": [
    "OpenStore is synchronous; asynchronous Service initialization/runtime retention and lifecycle hooks are deferred",
    "close stops observation/dispatch and does not drain all sealed/open buckets or prove late callback completion",
    "SIGKILL can lose any not-yet-confirmed RAM tail; restart records unknown gap and never asserts zero bytes",
    "whole history plus independent state restore/deletion cannot be detected without an external anchor",
    "fsync correctness assumes supported Linux filesystem/storage; process-kill tests do not prove power-loss behavior",
    "private local receipt has no Core/source epoch/Provider/grant/Terms ownership and cannot authorize billing",
    "callback timestamps represent completion only; old UDP counter mapping remains explicitly different from physical direction",
    "there is no GC; capacity deliberately stops observation while v1 counters and reports continue",
    "failure leaves pending/head evidence requiring explicit recovery; no automatic promotion or overwrite"
